{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11309100","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11309100","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1130910001:1":{"text":"いや、まったく違うね。今は積極的に攻撃してこないだろ！","source_cn":"不，区别可大了，它们现在不会主动攻击我们了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6E7C4629F323FAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130910002:1":{"text":"これで、商路が開かれたわけだ。俺たちはこのままクリムゾン高原を目指すことができる。","source_cn":"这样一来，商路就畅通了，我们可以继续出发去深红高原了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B5748BC58B906C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130910003:1":{"text":"だが、クリムゾン高原に奇妙な黒い魔物が現れたらしい……","source_cn":"但我听说，深红高原有奇怪的黑色魔物……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3492544BBA7EE3FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1130910004:1":{"text":"よく考えてみろ、クリムゾン高原の財宝もデマだった。それなら、その魔物もただの噂かもしれないだろ！なんでも鵜吞みにしてて商人が務まるかよ。","source_cn":"好好想想，深红高原的宝藏是假的，那魔物传言也可能是假的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7AC5BF220CB5294D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:行商德博拉":{"text":"行商人のデボラ","source":"行商德博拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:行商乔瑟夫":{"text":"行商人のジョーセフ","source":"行商乔瑟夫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}